# Stray gbrain config copies. The canonical file is ~/.gbrain/config.json and it
# contains the live Supabase connection string, password included. A byte-identical
# copy appeared at this repo root on 2026-07-24 and was one `git add -A` away from
# being committed. Never commit this; the credential belongs in KeePassXC.
/config.json

# Paperclip agent worktrees: each is its own git checkout (has its own .git),
# so `git add -A` in the parent repo sweeps it in as a gitlink/submodule
# reference instead of leaving it alone. Cost a stuck "modified" entry that
# survived rm/checkout because git tracked it as a submodule pointer, not files.
.paperclip/worktrees/

