# NOTE: *.csproj / *.slnx / *.asmdef are NOW tracked source — the deterministic core is real
# code under src/ and tests/. Do not blanket-ignore project files anymore.
#
# This is why the stock Unity .gitignore CANNOT be pasted in whole. Its `*.csproj`, `*.sln` and
# `*.slnx` lines would cover 17 hand-authored project files under src/ and tests/ plus the root
# Emberfall.slnx — the actual build. Only Unity's own generated ones are ignored, below.
#
# The other half of that template is inert here for a different reason: it assumes the Unity
# project sits at the REPO ROOT, so every `/`-anchored rule (`/[Ll]ibrary/`, `/[Aa]ssets/...`)
# matches nothing when the project lives at unity/. The rules below are unanchored or
# re-anchored on purpose. Do not "restore" the leading slashes.

# ── Unity-generated project files ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated from the .asmdef on every domain reload, so they churn constantly and are not
# source. 23 of these were tracked until 2026-08-07 and dirtied `git status` on every reload.
/unity/*.csproj
/unity/*.sln

# ── Unity / toolchain scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Native build tree from the Android IL2CPP toolchain. 55 files, 2.3 MB, were tracked.
.utmp/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
*.log
sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.*
crashlytics-build.properties
# The whole folder, not just *.log: Unity generates a .meta beside each log, and a rule that
# took the log but left its .meta would leave an orphaned .meta tracked forever.
unity/Assets/UnityMCP/Log/

# Editors / IDEs
.vs/
.gradle/
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.DotSettings.user
unity/Assets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Build and debug artefacts
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Blender writes a .blend1 backup beside every save
*.blend1
*.blend1.meta

# Player build outputs. NOT *.unitypackage — one is vendored inside the embedded
# com.unity.addressables.android package and is legitimately tracked.
*.apk
*.aab
*.app

