unity/Assets/Addressables_Temp*
unity/Assets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# Art generation candidates. Nothing in here is load-bearing (Sam, 2026-07-31): every final
# version already lives where it belongs under Assets/. The folder is kept only because it is
# Canonical art pipeline output. Everything a generator produces lands here — final resting
# place or staging area en route to Unity import. Untracked in full, no exceptions: the whole
# thing could be deleted and no build, test or asset would change. Kept because it is good to
# look at. (Superseded art-bakeoff/, retired 2026-08-06.)
art-pipeline/

# Python bytecode from the tooling/scripts generators
__pycache__/

# Local secrets (Gemini key etc.) - never commit
.env

# Agent Related
# .claude IS tracked: hooks, skills and agent definitions are project config, and they are only
# useful if they reach every worktree and agent checkout. Four things stay out of it —
#   - the vendored skill symlinks. They target ABSOLUTE paths into the ignored .agents/, and this
#     repo runs core.symlinks=false, so git would store each one as a text file containing
#     "/c/Users/User/Documents/...". skills-lock.json already pins them for reinstall.
#   - settings.local.json: per-user permissions and machine-absolute additionalDirectories.
#   - .playwright-mcp/: 2.7M of scratch page captures.
#   - worktrees/ and *.bak: transient.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.playwright-mcp/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/*.bak
.claude/skills/unity/
.claude/skills/gemini-interactions
.claude/skills/supabase
.claude/skills/supabase-postgres-best-practices
# Vendor-installed agent skills — .claude/skills/* are symlinks into here.
# Content is disposable; skills-lock.json (tracked) pins source + hash to reinstall it.
.agents

# Scratch match-replay logs from bot/networked smoke tests - disposable
scratch-replays/

# Unity AI-generation cache (Assistant/asset-gen scratch) - never commit
unity/GeneratedAssets/

# Loading-screen preview scratch renders (regenerable via offscreen rig)
/wordmark_preview.png

# Playwright MCP session artifacts
.playwright-mcp/

