# Card-art seeds are TRACKED. They were ignored by a bare rule here with no comment, which
# left the only copy of the hand-authored per-card art direction untracked on one disk - the
# same way docs/design/card-drafts-*.md was lost to the 2026-07-31 reorg. Seeds are the
# quality constraint on generated art (an unseeded card briefs from a placeholder the
# generator itself calls "plausible but general"), so they are source, not scratch.
# Generated CANDIDATES still belong in art-pipeline/, which is ignored in full.
# Added by code-review-graph
.code-review-graph/

