EDITOR-LOCK.md

# Written by the card-text test fixtures on every run — a report, never an input.
card-text-audit.txt
corpus-behaviour-sweep.txt
card-text-parser-coverage.txt
card-text-parser-refusals.txt

# #195 build stamp — GENERATED by BuildStampWriter on every build, and deliberately never
# committed. A stamp in git would claim a commit that is not the one being built, which is worse
# than no stamp: the whole point is that a tester's report can be trusted to name their build.
unity/Assets/Resources/build-stamp.txt
unity/Assets/Resources/build-stamp.txt.meta

.gbrain-owner.json